Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Windows (MinGW): the host model's memory over
 VirtualAlloc, the shader cache's POSIX code over a small shim (flock on a far
 byte, mmap of the index)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
