+/* The four things the model asks of the system: reserve the window, make part
+ * of it usable or reserved again, and map or unmap private memory. Windows
+ * hands out 64 KiB-aligned regions and frees only whole ones, so an aligned
+ * mapping there is reserved over, released, and taken again at its start. */
